OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786211302
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway workers strike
OL,4,Cagain in dispute over safety
OL,6,FWorkers at East Midlands Railway are
OL,7,Fstriking again today in an ongoing
OL,8,Fdispute over safety.
OL,10,FThe Rail, Maritime and Transport union
OL,11,Fhas been in dispute with EMR since
OL,12,FApril following the roll out of an 810
OL,13,Ffleet which the union claimed has been
OL,14,Foperating with a number of faults.
OL,16,FThe company denied the claim.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/8
