OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786211302
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway workers strike
OL,4,Cagain in dispute over safety
OL,6,FRMT general secretary Eddie Dempsey
OL,7,Fsaid: "On top of faulty toilets,
OL,8,Fbroken air con systems and
OL,9,Fcommunication and door issues we are
OL,10,Fseeing trains stranded on the track
OL,11,Fand staff are losing confidence in
OL,12,Fsafety levels.
OL,14,F"RMT is demanding that whilst these
OL,15,Ffaults exist and until these trains
OL,16,Fare shown to be operating properly,
OL,17,Fthey should be taken out of service."
OL,19,FRMT members were picketing outside
OL,20,FNottingham Railway station today.
OL,26,@oD@GOUvD@AOUyD@eO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786211302
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway workers strike
OL,4,Cagain in dispute over safety
OL,6,FIt's the second of three strikes
OL,7,Ftaking place across three consecutive
OL,8,FSaturdays.
OL,10,FA company spokesperson said: "EMR
OL,11,Fremains committed to delivering the
OL,12,Fsafe, reliable, high-performing and
OL,13,Fpunctual service our customers expect,
OL,14,Fwhile operating a railway our
OL,15,Fcolleagues can be proud to be part of.
OL,26,@rD@^OU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786211302
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway workers strike
OL,4,Cagain in dispute over safety
OL,6,F"When EMR selected Hitachi to build
OL,7,Fand maintain the new Aurora intercity
OL,8,Ftrains and to maintain the outgoing
OL,9,Ffleet, we did so based on its global
OL,10,Freputation for engineering excellence
OL,11,Fand the proven performance of its
OL,12,Ftrains across the UK rail network and
OL,13,Finternationally.
OL,15,F"That reputation is why we remain
OL,16,Fconfident that Hitachi, which has also
OL,17,Fbeen invited by Northern to bid for
OL,18,Fits new train fleet, will address all
OL,19,Fthe performance issues that we have
OL,20,Fconsistently pressed for.
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786211302
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway workers strike
OL,4,Cagain in dispute over safety
OL,6,F"We have agreed an integrated action
OL,7,Fplan to support this work and look
OL,8,Fforward to seeing rapid improvements,
OL,9,Fwith Hitachi's Global Executive
OL,10,FLeadership team now directly involved
OL,11,Fand bringing its expertise to bear.
OL,13,F"Despite the reliability issues, all
OL,14,FEMR trains, including the Class 810
OL,15,Ffleet, have been licensed by the
OL,16,FOffice of Rail and Road (ORR) and only
OL,17,Fentered service after successfully
OL,18,Fcompleting all required testing and
OL,19,Fmeeting the regulator's rigorous
OL,20,Fsafety standards.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786211302
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway workers strike
OL,4,Cagain in dispute over safety
OL,6,F"Hitachi's increased focus was both
OL,7,Fnecessary and welcome. We will
OL,8,Fcontinue to work closely with Hitachi
OL,9,Fto ensure these issues are resolved
OL,10,Ffor the benefit of our colleagues and
OL,11,Fcustomers."
OL,13,FA Hitachi Rail spokesperson said: "We
OL,14,Fare working closely with all industry
OL,15,Fpartners to implement the agreed
OL,16,Fintegrated action plan.
OL,18,F"This is already being delivered
OL,19,Facross both the Class 810 and Class
OL,20,F222 fleets.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@KO]uD@cOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786211302
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway workers strike
OL,4,Cagain in dispute over safety
OL,6,F"The Class 810 fleet underwent
OL,7,Fextensive testing, assurance and
OL,8,Findependent approval processes before
OL,9,Fentering passenger service.
OL,11,F"Modifications identified during the
OL,12,Fentry-into-service phase are already
OL,13,Fbeing implemented and progress is well
OL,14,Funder way.
OL,16,F"We are also increasing maintenance
OL,17,Factivity and working closely with our
OL,18,Fsupply chain to improve the
OL,19,Favailability of materials and
OL,20,Fcomponents for the Class 222 fleet.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786211302
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway workers strike
OL,4,Cagain in dispute over safety
OL,6,F"To increase capacity for
OL,7,Fmodifications and testing, we have
OL,8,Finvested in additional activity at
OL,9,FLong Marston Rail Innovation Centre.
OL,11,F"This will support software
OL,12,Fimplementation, testing and continued
OL,13,Ffleet introduction, progressing the
OL,14,Ftransition from older to newer trains.
OL,16,F"We apologise for the inconvenience
OL,17,Fcaused. We are focused on working with
OL,18,Fall partners to resolve the situation."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUxD@AOUzD@gO]
